{"v":1,"path":"/Components/IVirtualStickManager/IVirtualStickManager.html","title":"DJI Mobile SDK Documentation","mainClass":"site-main","tocClass":"site-toc","mainHtml":"\n        <div id=\"ifm-overview\" class=\"article ifm-page\" data-prerender=\"overview members methods\"><div class=\"article\" style=\"display: none;\"><h1><font color=\"#AAA\">class </font>IVirtualStickManager</h1></div>\n<figure class=\"highlight java\" style=\"display: none;\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">interface</span> <span class=\"title class_\">IVirtualStickManager</span> </span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>包：</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<nav class=\"ifm-breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"面包屑\"><span>Common APIs</span><span class=\"ifm-breadcrumb-sep\">›</span><span aria-current=\"page\">IVirtualStickManager</span></nav><div class=\"ifm-eyebrow\" id=\"ifm-overview\"><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-kind-badge\">class</span><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-since-badge\">Since MSDK 5.0.0</span></div><h1 class=\"ifm-title\">IVirtualStickManager</h1><p class=\"ifm-lead\">此类是虚拟摇杆管理类，用于开启、关闭虚拟摇杆模式，并提供虚拟摇杆状态监听，虚拟摇杆移动量的获取与设置等功能。</p><div class=\"ifm-meta-line\"><span class=\"ifm-meta-item\"><svg class=\"ifm-meta-icon\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 7.5 12 3l8 4.5v9L12 21l-8-4.5z\"></path><path d=\"m4 7.5 8 4.5 8-4.5M12 12v9\"></path></svg>Package <code>dji.v5.manager.interfaces</code><button class=\"ifm-mini-copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy=\"dji.v5.manager.interfaces\" aria-label=\"复制包名\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M16 8V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v8a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h2\"></path></svg></button></span><span class=\"ifm-meta-item\"><svg class=\"ifm-meta-icon\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"></circle><path d=\"M12 7v5l3 2\"></path></svg>Android · Java / Kotlin</span></div><h5 id=\"描述：\" style=\"display: none;\">描述：</h5>\n<p style=\"display: none;\"><font color=\"#666\">此类是虚拟摇杆管理类，用于开启、关闭虚拟摇杆模式，并提供虚拟摇杆状态监听，虚拟摇杆移动量的获取与设置等功能。 <br><br><code><i>MSDK 5.0.0开始支持</i></code></font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"ifm-members-section\" id=\"ifm-members-nav\"><div class=\"ifm-section-head\"><h2>成员</h2><span class=\"ifm-section-note\"><span class=\"ifm-count\">15</span> 个成员</span></div><div class=\"ifm-member-tools\"><div class=\"ifm-member-search\"><svg class=\"ifm-search-icon\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"7\"></circle><path d=\"m20 20-3.4-3.4\"></path></svg><input type=\"search\" id=\"ifm-search\" placeholder=\"按名称、参数或描述筛选\" aria-label=\"筛选成员\"><button class=\"ifm-search-clear\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"清空搜索\" hidden=\"\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 6l12 12M18 6 6 18\"></path></svg></button></div><div class=\"ifm-filter-group\"><button class=\"ifm-filter-btn\" data-filter=\"all\" aria-pressed=\"true\">全部</button><button class=\"ifm-filter-btn\" data-filter=\"listener\">监听</button><button class=\"ifm-filter-btn\" data-filter=\"method\">方法</button><button class=\"ifm-filter-btn\" data-filter=\"enum\">枚举</button><button class=\"ifm-filter-btn\" data-filter=\"class\">Class</button></div></div><div class=\"ifm-member-groups\" id=\"ifm-groups\"><div class=\"ifm-member-group\" data-group=\"listener\"><div class=\"ifm-member-group-head\"><h3>监听</h3><span class=\"ifm-member-count\">2</span></div><div class=\"ifm-member-list\"><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"ivirtualstickmanager_removevirtualstickstatelistener_inline\" data-category=\"listener\" data-search=\"removevirtualstickstatelistener 移除虚拟遥杆状态的监听器。\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">removeVirtualStickStateListener</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">移除虚拟遥杆状态的监听器。</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"ivirtualstickmanager_clearallvirtualstickstatelistener_inline\" data-category=\"listener\" data-search=\"clearallvirtualstickstatelistener 移除所有虚拟遥杆状态的监听器。\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">clearAllVirtualStickStateListener</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">移除所有虚拟遥杆状态的监听器。</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button></div></div><div class=\"ifm-member-group\" data-group=\"method\"><div class=\"ifm-member-group-head\"><h3>方法</h3><span class=\"ifm-member-count\">7</span></div><div class=\"ifm-member-list\"><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"ivirtualstickmanager_enablevirtualstick_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"enablevirtualstick 开启虚拟摇杆模式。\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">enableVirtualStick</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">开启虚拟摇杆模式。</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"ivirtualstickmanager_disablevirtualstick_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"disablevirtualstick 关闭虚拟摇杆模式。\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">disableVirtualStick</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">关闭虚拟摇杆模式。</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"ivirtualstickmanager_getleftstick_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"getleftstick 获取虚拟摇杆中的左遥杆实例。左摇杆控制飞行器偏航轴和油门：\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">getLeftStick</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">获取虚拟摇杆中的左遥杆实例。左摇杆控制飞行器偏航轴和油门：</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"ivirtualstickmanager_getrightstick_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"getrightstick 获取虚拟摇杆中的右遥杆实例。右摇杆控制飞行器横滚轴和俯仰轴：\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">getRightStick</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">获取虚拟摇杆中的右遥杆实例。右摇杆控制飞行器横滚轴和俯仰轴：</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"ivirtualstickmanager_setvirtualstickadvancedmodeenabled_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"setvirtualstickadvancedmodeenabled 开启虚拟摇杆高级模式。在高级模式下，左摇杆getleftstick和右摇杆getleftstick的控制数据将不再生效，你可以调用sendvirtualstickadvancedparam设置更高级的控制参数，用于使用更复杂的应用场景，比如用虚拟摇杆实现航线相关功能。\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">setVirtualStickAdvancedModeEnabled</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">开启虚拟摇杆高级模式。在高级模式下，左摇杆getLeftStick和右摇杆getLeftStick的控制数据将不再生效，你可以调用sendVirtualStickAdvancedParam设置更高级的控制参数，用于使用更复杂的应用场景，比如用虚拟摇杆实现航线相关功能。</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"ivirtualstickmanager_sendvirtualstickadvancedparam_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"sendvirtualstickadvancedparam 发送虚拟摇杆高级控制参数。\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">sendVirtualStickAdvancedParam</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">发送虚拟摇杆高级控制参数。</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"ivirtualstickmanager_setvirtualstickstatelistener_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"setvirtualstickstatelistener 设置虚拟遥杆状态的监听器。\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">setVirtualStickStateListener</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">设置虚拟遥杆状态的监听器。</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button></div></div><div class=\"ifm-member-group\" data-group=\"enum\"><div class=\"ifm-member-group-head\"><h3>枚举</h3><span class=\"ifm-member-count\">2</span></div><div class=\"ifm-member-list\"><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"value_flightcontroller_enum_flightcontrolauthority_inline\" data-category=\"enum\" data-search=\"flightcontrolauthority 飞行控制权。\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">enum</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">FlightControlAuthority</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">飞行控制权。</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"value_flightcontroller_enum_flightcontrolauthoritychangereason_inline\" data-category=\"enum\" data-search=\"flightcontrolauthoritychangereason 飞行控制权变更原因。\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">enum</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">FlightControlAuthorityChangeReason</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">飞行控制权变更原因。</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button></div></div><div class=\"ifm-member-group\" data-group=\"class\"><div class=\"ifm-member-group-head\"><h3>Class</h3><span class=\"ifm-member-count\">4</span></div><div class=\"ifm-member-list\"><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"ivirtualstickmanager_djistick_inline\" data-category=\"class\" data-search=\"istick 虚拟摇杆类。用于虚拟摇杆移动量的设置和获取。\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">class</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">IStick</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">虚拟摇杆类。用于虚拟摇杆移动量的设置和获取。</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"value_flightcontroller_struct_virtualstickflightcontrolparam_inline\" data-category=\"class\" data-search=\"virtualstickflightcontrolparam 虚拟摇杆高级控制参数。\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">class</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">VirtualStickFlightControlParam</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">虚拟摇杆高级控制参数。</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"ivirtualstickmanager_virtualstickstatelistener_inline\" data-category=\"class\" data-search=\"virtualstickstatelistener 虚拟遥杆状态监听器。\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">class</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">VirtualStickStateListener</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">虚拟遥杆状态监听器。</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"ivirtualstickmanager_virtualstickstate_inline\" data-category=\"class\" data-search=\"virtualstickstate 虚拟遥杆功能状态。\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">class</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">VirtualStickState</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">虚拟遥杆功能状态。</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button></div></div></div><div class=\"ifm-empty-state\" id=\"ifm-empty\" style=\"display:none\">没有匹配的成员，请尝试更短的关键词。</div></div>\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"ivirtualstickmanager_enablevirtualstick\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#ivirtualstickmanager_enablevirtualstick_inline\">enableVirtualStick</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"ivirtualstickmanager_enablevirtualstick_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>enableVirtualStick</h3><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-since-badge\">Since MSDK 5.0.0</span></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">enableVirtualStick</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-prefix\">CommonCallbacks</span><wbr><span class=\"jv-punct\">.</span><span class=\"jv-type\">CompletionCallback</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">callback</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>包：</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">开启虚拟摇杆模式。 <br></font></p><div class=\"ifm-callout\"><font color=\"#666\"><strong>注意</strong><br><br> 1. 出于飞行安全考虑，飞行器在靠近限飞区或者限远距离30米时，遥控器会夺取飞行器控制权，虚拟摇杆功能无法使用。<br> 2. 虚拟摇杆普通模式默认支持避障。<br> 3. 虚拟摇杆高级模式下只有在垂直方向控制模式是速度模式，偏航轴控制模式是角速度并且横滚和俯仰轴控制模式是速度模式的组合下才支持避障。<br> 4. 目前只有 M300 RTK，M350 RTK，M30 系列和 Mavic 3E 系列和 Mavic 3M 飞行器支持在虚拟摇杆模式下避障。<br> 5. 若 Mavic 3E 系列和 Mavic 3M 机型固件版本低于 V7.01.10.03，在虚拟摇杆模式启动时，视觉避障不生效，建议升级到最新固件版本。<br> </font></div><p></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">参数</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table\"><thead><tr><th>名称</th><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>callback</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><a href=\"../DJICommonCallbacks/DJICommonCallbacks.html#djicommoncallbacks\"><span class=\"jv-prefix\">CommonCallbacks</span></a><wbr><span class=\"jv-punct\">.</span><a href=\"../DJICommonCallbacks/DJICommonCallbacks_CompletionCallback.html#djicommoncallbacks_completioncallback\"><span class=\"jv-type\">CompletionCallback</span></a> </code></span></td><td>返回执行结果的回调。</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"ivirtualstickmanager_disablevirtualstick\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#ivirtualstickmanager_disablevirtualstick_inline\">disableVirtualStick</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"ivirtualstickmanager_disablevirtualstick_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>disableVirtualStick</h3><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-since-badge\">Since MSDK 5.0.0</span></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">disableVirtualStick</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-prefix\">CommonCallbacks</span><wbr><span class=\"jv-punct\">.</span><span class=\"jv-type\">CompletionCallback</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">callback</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>包：</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">关闭虚拟摇杆模式。</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">参数</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table\"><thead><tr><th>名称</th><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>callback</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><a href=\"../DJICommonCallbacks/DJICommonCallbacks.html#djicommoncallbacks\"><span class=\"jv-prefix\">CommonCallbacks</span></a><wbr><span class=\"jv-punct\">.</span><a href=\"../DJICommonCallbacks/DJICommonCallbacks_CompletionCallback.html#djicommoncallbacks_completioncallback\"><span class=\"jv-type\">CompletionCallback</span></a> </code></span></td><td>返回执行结果的回调。</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"ivirtualstickmanager_getleftstick\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#ivirtualstickmanager_getleftstick_inline\">getLeftStick</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"ivirtualstickmanager_getleftstick_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>getLeftStick</h3><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-since-badge\">Since MSDK 5.0.0</span></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-type\">IStick</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">getLeftStick</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>包：</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">获取虚拟摇杆中的左遥杆实例。左摇杆控制飞行器偏航轴和油门：</font></p><ul><font color=\"#666\"> <li>此摇杆向左移动的时候（horizontalPosition为负数），俯视飞行器视角下，飞行器会逆时针转动。</li> <li>此摇杆向右移动的时候（horizontalPosition为正数），俯视飞行器视角下，飞行器会顺时针转动。</li> <li>此摇杆向上移动的时候（verticalPosition为正数），飞行器会升高自身高度。</li> <li>此摇杆向下移动的时候（verticalPosition为负数），飞行器会降低自身高度。</li> </font></ul><font color=\"#666\"> <br><br><code><i>MSDK 5.0.0开始支持</i></code><p></p>\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading ifm-return-heading\">返回值</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-return-table\"><thead><tr><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><a href=\"IVirtualStickManager_DJIStick.html#ivirtualstickmanager_djistick\"><span class=\"jv-type\">IStick</span></a></code></span></td><td>返回左摇杆实例。</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"ivirtualstickmanager_getrightstick\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#ivirtualstickmanager_getrightstick_inline\">getRightStick</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"ivirtualstickmanager_getrightstick_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>getRightStick</h3><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-since-badge\">Since MSDK 5.0.0</span></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-type\">IStick</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">getRightStick</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>包：</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">获取虚拟摇杆中的右遥杆实例。右摇杆控制飞行器横滚轴和俯仰轴：</font></p><ul><font color=\"#666\"> <li>此摇杆往左移动的时候（horizontalPosition为负数），飞行器自身视角下，飞行器会往左飞行。</li> <li>此摇杆往右移动的时候（horizontalPosition为正数），飞行器自身视角下，飞行器会往右边飞行。</li> <li>此摇杆向上移动的时候（verticalPosition为正数），飞行器自身视角下，飞行器会往前飞。</li> <li>此摇杆向下移动的时候（verticalPosition为负数），飞行器自身视角下，飞行器会往后飞。</li> </font></ul><font color=\"#666\"> <br><br><code><i>MSDK 5.0.0开始支持</i></code><p></p>\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading ifm-return-heading\">返回值</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-return-table\"><thead><tr><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><a href=\"IVirtualStickManager_DJIStick.html#ivirtualstickmanager_djistick\"><span class=\"jv-type\">IStick</span></a></code></span></td><td>返回右摇杆实例。</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"ivirtualstickmanager_setvirtualstickadvancedmodeenabled\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#ivirtualstickmanager_setvirtualstickadvancedmodeenabled_inline\">setVirtualStickAdvancedModeEnabled</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"ivirtualstickmanager_setvirtualstickadvancedmodeenabled_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>setVirtualStickAdvancedModeEnabled</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">setVirtualStickAdvancedModeEnabled</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-keyword\">boolean</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">isEnabled</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>包：</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">开启虚拟摇杆高级模式。在高级模式下，左摇杆<code><a href=\"IVirtualStickManager.html#ivirtualstickmanager_getleftstick\">getLeftStick</a></code>和右摇杆<code><a href=\"IVirtualStickManager.html#ivirtualstickmanager_getleftstick\">getLeftStick</a></code>的控制数据将不再生效，你可以调用<code><a href=\"IVirtualStickManager.html#ivirtualstickmanager_sendvirtualstickadvancedparam\">sendVirtualStickAdvancedParam</a></code>设置更高级的控制参数，用于使用更复杂的应用场景，比如用虚拟摇杆实现航线相关功能。 <br><br><code><i>MSDK 5.1 .0开始支持</i></code></font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">参数</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table\"><thead><tr><th>名称</th><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>isEnabled</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">boolean</span> </code></span></td><td>true表示开启虚拟摇杆高级模式。</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"ivirtualstickmanager_sendvirtualstickadvancedparam\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#ivirtualstickmanager_sendvirtualstickadvancedparam_inline\">sendVirtualStickAdvancedParam</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"ivirtualstickmanager_sendvirtualstickadvancedparam_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>sendVirtualStickAdvancedParam</h3><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-since-badge\">Since MSDK 5.1.0</span></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">sendVirtualStickAdvancedParam</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-annotation\">@NonNull</span> <wbr><span class=\"jv-type\">VirtualStickFlightControlParam</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">param</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>包：</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">发送虚拟摇杆高级控制参数。</font></p><li><font color=\"#666\">请先调用<code><a href=\"IVirtualStickManager.html#ivirtualstickmanager_setvirtualstickadvancedmodeenabled\">setVirtualStickAdvancedModeEnabled</a></code>把高级模式打开后才能使用此接口。</font></li><font color=\"#666\"> <li>开发者可以根据自己的需求按照特定的频率发送控制参数，建议发送频率在5Hz到25Hz之间。</li> <li>高级控制参数的详细用法，请参阅<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://developer.dji.com/doc/mobile-sdk-tutorial/cn/basic-introduction/basic-concepts/flight-controller.html#%E8%99%9A%E6%8B%9F%E6%91%87%E6%9D%86\">虚拟摇杆</a></li> <li>高级控制参数范围请参考：<code><a href=\"IVirtualStickManager_VirtualStickRange.html#ivirtualstickmanager_virtualstickrange\">VirtualStickRange</a></code></li> <br><br><code><i>MSDK 5.1.0开始支持</i></code><p></p>\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">参数</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table\"><thead><tr><th>名称</th><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>param</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-annotation\">@NonNull</span> <wbr><a href=\"Value_FlightController_Struct_VirtualStickFlightControlParam.html#value_flightcontroller_struct_virtualstickflightcontrolparam\"><span class=\"jv-type\">VirtualStickFlightControlParam</span></a> </code></span></td><td>高级模式参数。</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"ivirtualstickmanager_setvirtualstickstatelistener\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#ivirtualstickmanager_setvirtualstickstatelistener_inline\">setVirtualStickStateListener</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"ivirtualstickmanager_setvirtualstickstatelistener_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>setVirtualStickStateListener</h3><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-since-badge\">Since MSDK 5.0.0</span></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">setVirtualStickStateListener</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-type\">VirtualStickStateListener</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">listener</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>包：</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">设置虚拟遥杆状态的监听器。</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">参数</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table\"><thead><tr><th>名称</th><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>listener</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><a href=\"IVirtualStickManager_VirtualStickStateListener.html#ivirtualstickmanager_virtualstickstatelistener\"><span class=\"jv-type\">VirtualStickStateListener</span></a> </code></span></td><td>虚拟遥杆状态的监听器</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"ivirtualstickmanager_removevirtualstickstatelistener\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#ivirtualstickmanager_removevirtualstickstatelistener_inline\">removeVirtualStickStateListener</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"ivirtualstickmanager_removevirtualstickstatelistener_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>removeVirtualStickStateListener</h3><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-since-badge\">Since MSDK 5.0.0</span></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">removeVirtualStickStateListener</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-type\">VirtualStickStateListener</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">listener</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>包：</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">移除虚拟遥杆状态的监听器。</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">参数</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table\"><thead><tr><th>名称</th><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>listener</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><a href=\"IVirtualStickManager_VirtualStickStateListener.html#ivirtualstickmanager_virtualstickstatelistener\"><span class=\"jv-type\">VirtualStickStateListener</span></a> </code></span></td><td>虚拟遥杆状态的监听器</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"ivirtualstickmanager_clearallvirtualstickstatelistener\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#ivirtualstickmanager_clearallvirtualstickstatelistener_inline\">clearAllVirtualStickStateListener</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"ivirtualstickmanager_clearallvirtualstickstatelistener_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>clearAllVirtualStickS